#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/tiny3.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Domain hits
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: YES
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	98	NP_414546.1 DUF2502 domain-containing protein YaaX [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_1	Non-specific	491353	25	72	5.98936e-13	58.8715	pfam10697	DUF2502	C	-
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
SESSION	2	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	79	NP_414783.1 protein YkfF [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
2	Query_2	Specific	488084	5	74	5.04742e-43	133.904	pfam06006	DUF905	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	2
SESSION	3	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_3	Peptide	56	NP_415080.1 NinE family prophage protein [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
3	Query_3	Specific	507081	1	56	1.56002e-28	95.812	NF007245	PRK09689	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SUPERFAMILIES
ENDSUPERFAMILIES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	3
ENDDATA
